## Changelog

### 0.2.1

Change default `replacement_domain` from `xcancel.com` to `twiiit.com`, as it's
unclear whether XCancel will ever resume normal operations.


### 0.2.0

Add config setting to choose a replacement domain other than `xcancel.com`.


### 0.1.2

Tighten up matching; add manually-run test suite.


### 0.1.1

Remove partially broken import of `alternate_domains` from `sopel-twitter`.


### 0.1.0

First release of `sopel-cancelx`.
